+## Codex `/btw` 旁支问答
+
+共享 Connector 的 Codex 会话支持 `/btw 你的问题`。主任务运行、等待输入或审批时也可执行；命令立即确认，中文答案随后更新同一条 system 时间线消息。单独发送 `/btw` 会重开上次已完成的问答，不再次调用模型。
+
+旁支只读取最近 30 条原生记录，工具结果每条最多 800 字符，总转录最多 16,000 字符；不读取文件、不执行工具，也不把问题或答案写入 Codex 模型历史。一次 Responses 请求显式发送 `tools: []`、`tool_choice: none` 和 `store: false`。沿用当前选择的模型、AA 模型网关或 Codex 的 Responses 提供方；普通 API key、环境变量凭据和可由 App Server 导出的 ChatGPT 登录可用。AWS 等非 Responses 提供方及不可导出的托管凭据会明确报错，不切换其他账号或提供方。
+
+问答记录保存在 Connector 自有的运行时状态中，不修改原生 Codex 会话文件。共享服务重启后仍可查看、重开；未完成问答标记为中断。每会话只运行一条旁支，120 秒超时，失败后可重试。实时推送失败时，下一次历史同步恢复同一条消息。当前只扩展 AA 入口，不修改 Codex CLI 的斜杠命令或终端界面。
+
+容器验证见 Pi 集成仓库的维护手册。`tests/test_codex_btw_live.py` 使用真实固定版 Codex 和本地确定性 Responses 服务，验证主任务未完成时旁支已经到达、最终历史不重复且不包含旁支问题；无需真实账号或付费调用。普通登录及网关的真实云端调用须另行验收。
+
 ## Layout
 
 ```text
@@ -211,3 +221,34 @@ uv run pytest -q
 ```
 
 DSH 插件默认将私有数据存放在 `~/.agents-anywhere/dsh-bridge-next/`，其托管 Connector 通过 `AGENT_CONNECTOR_DATA_DIR` 使用其中的 `connector/` 子目录。插件首次启动负责迁移旧 `.agentsanywhere/dsh-bridge-next/` 数据；通用 Connector 的默认路径和自定义环境变量行为不变。
+
+
+## Shared service and installed Runtime extensions
+
+`anywhere-cli serve` runs the per-user Connector independently of any UI process.
+It owns one device identity, config and RuntimeLease, and publishes a 0600 MeshCall
+rendezvous at `~/.agents-anywhere/connector-service` (Router endpoint plus a scoped
+`service` key). Disconnecting a manager does not stop Agent runtimes; only explicit
+stop/restart commands do. `anywhere-cli doctor --expect-runtime pi --expect-runtime dsh`
+reads that rendezvous, emits JSON and exits nonzero when the installation or the
+service is unhealthy. It does not verify backend presence or a model turn.
+
+Installed Python providers are discovered through the versioned entry point group
+`agents_anywhere.runtime_providers.v1`. Built-in providers remain unchanged and
+cannot be replaced by extensions. See [the extension contract](../docs/runtime-protocol/runtime-extensions.md)
+and [the shared service contract](../contracts/connector-service/v1/README.md).
+The shared service targets Unix systems; `anywhere-cli rpc` and the CLI remain available.
+
+
+### Updating runtime extension code
+
+Runtime entry points load Python code into the shared Connector process; they do
+not provide hot reload or a separate worker. After installing a new extension or
+Connector wheel, restart the host process (`systemctl --user restart
+agents-anywhere-connector.service` in the shared-service deployment). All runtimes
+on that device may be interrupted, so wait for active work to settle first.
+
+The control RPC `restart` only rebuilds the backend task inside the same Python
+process. It does not reliably load changed modules. Neither restarting a single
+Runtime nor Pi's native `/reload` substitutes for a process restart. Editing a
+source checkout also has no effect on an installed wheel.
